OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FElizabeth showcases the best
OL,7,     Fperformances from the UK and
OL,8,     Fbeyond, including Dvorak's
OL,9,     FSymphony No.6 and Richard
OL,10,     FStrauss's tone poem Don Quixote.
OL,11,G1600 Composer of the Week: Leonard
OL,12,G     Bernstein
OL,13,     F5/5. Donald Macleod explores the
OL,14,     Ffinal years in the life of Leonard
OL,15,     FBernstein, when his behaviour
OL,16,     Fbecame more erratic, but he also
OL,17,     Fbecame more active in his work for
OL,18,     Fcharitable causes.
OL,19,G1700 In Tune
OL,20,     FMatthew Barley and Mishka Rushdie
OL,21,     FMomen play live. Ellie Neate on
OL,22,     FThe Marriage of Figaro.
