OL,11,     FThe Iceland Philharmonic Choir
OL,12,     Fjoin the BBC Concert Orchestra and
OL,13,     FChief Conductor Anna-Maria Helsing
OL,14,     Fin Snape Maltings for a concert of
OL,15,     Fsummer music. Presented by Sarah
OL,16,     FWalker.
OL,17,G2145 The Essay: Our Island Music
OL,18,     FEel Pie island lies just 20 metres
OL,19,     Fover the Thames at Twickenham. It
OL,20,     Fhas a long history of jazz and
OL,21,     Frock and became a landmark of
OL,22,     FBritish music.
